<http://hgnc.project-genesis.io#FAMILY_1101> rdfs:label "Myosin heavy chains, class VI" ;
    rdfs:comment "Due to a unique addition to the lever arm-positioning region (converter), class VI myosins move in the opposite direction (toward the minus-end of actin filaments) compared to other characterized myosin classes." ;
