<http://hgnc.project-genesis.io#FAMILY_1196> rdfs:label "Mannosidases type beta" ;
    rdfs:comment "Beta-mannosidase ( EC 3.2.1.25, mannanase, mannase, beta-D-mannosidase, beta-mannoside mannohydrolase, exo-beta-D-mannanase, lysosomal beta A mannosidase ) is an enzyme with system name beta-D-mannoside mannohydrolase, which is in humans encoded by the MANBA gene." ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <http://hgnc.project-genesis.io#FAMILY_1191> .

