<http://hgnc.project-genesis.io#FAMILY_145> rdfs:label "Zinc fingers LYAR C2HC-type" ;
    rdfs:comment "LYAR, which is known to be expressed abundantly in the testis, encodes a nucleolar protein that contain a LYAR-type C2HC zinc finger motif and three nuclear localization signals." ;
